  - verbosity bias
  - bias interaction
  - prediction-powered inference
  - leaderboard evaluation
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, gold-free real-judge pilot data, and frozen
  analysis pipeline for the paper "Toward Interaction-Aware Bias Correction
  in LLM-as-a-Judge Evaluation: The Bias Interaction Coefficient and
  Interaction-Aware Prediction-Powered Inference". Includes the
  Swap-Symmetry Interaction Test (SSIT), Interaction-Aware Swap Correction
  (IASC), Interaction-Aware Prediction-Powered Inference (IA-PPI), the
  coverage and leaderboard-impact simulations, and a multi-provider
  free-tier judgment collector.
